    {
      "source": "Add <a href=\"../server/RSocketServerCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.rsocket.server\"><code>RSocketServerCustomizer</code></a>s that should be called to configure the\n<code>RSocketServer</code>.",
      "translation": "添加用于配置 `<code>RSocketServer</code>` 的 <a href=\"../server/RSocketServerCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.rsocket.server\"><code>RSocketServerCustomizer</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>rSocketServerCustomizers</code> - customizers to apply before the server starts",
      "translation": "<code>rSocketServerCustomizers</code> - 在服务器启动之前应用的自定义器",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Gets a new fully configured but paused <a href=\"../server/RSocketServer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.rsocket.server\"><code>RSocketServer</code></a> instance. Clients\nshould not be able to connect to the returned server until\n<a href=\"../server/RSocketServer.html#start()\"><code>RSocketServer.start()</code></a> is called (which happens when the\n<code>ApplicationContext</code> has been fully refreshed).",
      "translation": "获取一个新的已完全配置但处于暂停状态的 <a href=\"../server/RSocketServer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.rsocket.server\"><code>RSocketServer</code></a> 实例。在调用 <a href=\"../server/RSocketServer.html#start()\"><code>RSocketServer.start()</code></a>（当 <code>ApplicationContext</code> 完全刷新时发生）之前，客户端不应能够连接到返回的服务器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../server/RSocketServerFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.rsocket.server\"><code>RSocketServerFactory</code></a> that can be used to create <a href=\"../server/RSocketServer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.rsocket.server\"><code>RSocketServer</code></a>s backed\nby Netty.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../server/RSocketServerFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.rsocket.server\"><code>RSocketServerFactory</code></a>，可用于创建由 Netty 支持的 <a href=\"../server/RSocketServer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.rsocket.server\"><code>RSocketServer</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
